      "message": "pd_power_supply_reset does exactly what this change does except fro setting setting the source voltage limit.\n\n```\nvoid pd_power_supply_reset(int port)\n{\n        /* Port 0 can never provide vbus. */\n        if (port \u003d\u003d CHG)\n                return;\n\n        /* Disable VBUS */\n        chg_power_select(CHG_POWER_OFF);\n        dut_chg_en(0);\n\n        /* DUT is lost, back to 5V limit on CHG */\n        pd_set_external_voltage_limit(CHG, PD_MIN_MV);\n}\n```\n\n\nWhat\u0027s the reason for not setting the source voltage limit?",
